FROM --platform=$BUILDPLATFORM node:26.8.1-alpine3.23@sha256:871eb674ad6e692c91330a8959f1ce2f80ba3f445cdc54e306869d2ea265e42d AS build
WORKDIR /src
RUN npm install --global pnpm@11.9.0 && pnpm --version
COPY package.json pnpm-lock.yaml pnpm-workspace.yaml .pnpmfile.cjs ./
COPY LICENSE NOTICE ./
COPY patches ./patches
COPY apps/web ./apps/web
RUN pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
RUN pnpm --dir apps/web build

FROM caddy:2.11.4-alpine@sha256:5f5c8640aae01df9654968d946d8f1a56c497f1dd5c5cda4cf95ab7c14d58648
COPY deploy/Caddyfile /etc/caddy/Caddyfile
COPY --from=build /src/apps/web/dist /srv
COPY --from=build /src/LICENSE /src/NOTICE /usr/share/licenses/pathlab-viewer/
